  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8e70547d8134d5943ac3fafcae79c9dc, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dectus
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventData
  title: Ruins of Dectus
  description: You find the ruins of the tower collapsed around the hill enveloped
    in this eternel snow. On your way into the fallen town, you notice blood traces
    leading to an open platoe. There lied Olaf, bleeding but still alive. In front
    of him a man in bandages pointing a Glaive at the dwarf. You choose to help the
    man that saved you before, soon realizing that the bandaged man is blind. Still
    he proved to be a serious threat, but not one that you could't conquer. Gods
    only know how this would end had he not been robbed of his sight.
  image: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  choices:
  - choiceText: Continue
    outcomeText: The fight was hard, but thanks to Olaf's determination he joined
      the fight to help you. This was his grave mistake, as even he couldn't hold
      the weight of his wounds. In the end he died fighting like a true warrior.
      You took his sword and swore to return it to Wagner as his last memento.
    goldChange: 0
    hpChangePercent: 0
    recruitCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    grantItems: []
    costItems: []
